  "prefLabel": "Ahp 104.03 Minutes of Board Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ahp 104.03 Minutes of Board Meetings.\n\n(a) Minutes of board meetings and of official actions taken by the boards shall be taken and preserved.\n\n(b) Such minutes shall:\n\n(1) Record the members participating in each vote;\n\n(2) Separately record the position of members who dissent, abstain, or concur; and\n\n(3) Be available for inspection by the pubic in accordance with Ahp 105.04.\n\nSource. #7401, eff 11-3-00; ss by #8077, eff 5-1-04; ss by #9517, eff 7-24-09 (formerly Ahp 103.04)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ahp100-600.html"
